      "message": "docs(readme): an experimental work in progress - use with caution\n\nAdds a second status note under the pre-1.0 banner: CamCraft is under\nheavy, fast-moving development, every posted program is a first draft to\nsimulate and dry-run, with a light-hearted nod to the famous 'some of you\nmay die' line and a pointer to report anything odd as an issue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
